**Task 1 (src/prompt.rs)**: Close model call lifecycle on InputRejected and other unclosed paths. When the model provider rejects input (InputRejected event), the code was recording the failure but not properly closing the model call lifecycle — leaving dangling "ModelCallStarted" without a matching "ModelCallCompleted". This continues the theme from earlier sessions about closing books properly.

